Hexium device-row sampler
-------------------------

Public API: hexium_browser.persona.sample_linux_chrome

The ancestral sampler and the packed network zips in ../data/ are derived
from Apache License 2.0 works (Apify fingerprint-suite datapoints and the
Python Bayesian sampler later published as BrowserForge). Hexium does not
ship JS injectors.

